# Entries above the user's level are grayed and give no command; one
# at the level gives its command.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER
S G0
# New item needs level 2
K ALT-I
S G1
K N
S G2
# every Admin entry is grayed: an arrow key and ENTER give nothing
K ALT-A
K DOWN
K ENTER
S G3
K ESC ESC
# an Admin entry
K ALT-A U
S G4
K ESC ESC
# Assemblies is allowed: it opens the assemblies, which ESC leaves
K ALT-I A
S G5
K ESC
S G6
# Search > Find text, whose dialog ESC leaves
K ALT-S T
S G7
K ESC
S G8
K ALT-F X
